{"quest_id": 6292, "name": "誘惑の赤き花", "description": "砦にて兵が反乱との報せ。王子を狙い\n兵を誘惑せし妖狐、堕姫を撃退せよ！\n＜妖狐がいる間誘惑された敵の能力上昇＞\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "modifier_notes": ["妖狐がいる間誘惑された敵の能力上昇"], "event": "傾国の妖狐と誘惑されし王子", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920099, "map_no": 5260, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "modifiers": [{"kind": "term", "influence": 11, "params": [300], "expression": "IsStageFlag( 1)&&(IsEnemyElementAny( \"チャーム\") == 1);", "expression_human": "stage flag 1 is set and (the enemy is element/tag チャーム == 1)"}, {"kind": "term", "influence": 18, "params": [300], "expression": "IsStageFlag( 1)&&(IsEnemyElementAny( \"チャーム\") == 1);", "expression_human": "stage flag 1 is set and (the enemy is element/tag チャーム == 1)"}], "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 6, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 140, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3, "spawn_sec": 2}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 12, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1500, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 1500, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 131, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097488, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 25, "global_id": 24, "spawn_sec": 17}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1100, "attack": 250, "base_hp": 1100, "base_attack": 250, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_range": 100, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 166, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097552, "race_id": 16, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 29, "global_id": 28, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 32}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2500, "attack": 350, "base_hp": 2500, "base_attack": 350, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 150, "attack_wait": 50, "attack_interval": 341, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2112624, "master_id": 30704, "global_id": 4323, "spawn_sec": 50}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー"], "hp": 3000, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 172, "move_speed": 450.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.399999976158142, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097504, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 26, "global_id": 25, "spawn_sec": 68}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー", "チャーム"], "hp": 3000, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 172, "move_speed": 450.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.399999976158142, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097504, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 222, "master_id": 30712, "global_id": 4331, "spawn_sec": 142}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2500, "attack": 120, "base_hp": 2500, "base_attack": 120, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 10, "magic_defense": 5, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 15, "attack_interval": 78, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2112784, "race_id": 4, "special_effect_id": 54, "master_id": 30721, "global_id": 4340, "route_behaviour": {"sets_flags": [[1, 1, 0], [1, 0, 0]]}, "spawn_sec": 145}, {"enemy_id": 8, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["チャーム"], "hp": 1500, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 1500, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 131, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097488, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 222, "master_id": 30711, "global_id": 4330, "spawn_sec": 146}, {"enemy_id": 9, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["チャーム"], "hp": 3200, "attack": 220, "base_hp": 3200, "base_attack": 220, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 40, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 162, "move_speed": 550.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097168, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 222, "master_id": 30710, "global_id": 4329, "spawn_sec": 148}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "兵士", "text": "ほ、報告！\n魔物に混じって人間の兵が攻めてきます！\n先日行方不明になった兵たちのようです！", "face": "u6"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "そんな……兵たちが反乱を起こすなんて。\n一体なにが起こっているのでしょうか？", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "ソーマ", "text": "あ！　見てください、王子。\n向こうに兵士たちを指揮している人がいますよ。", "face": "u23"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "あれは……堕姫さん？", "face": "lfd3f42c51a24"}, {"name": "堕姫", "text": "くふふ……よいぞ、どんどん行くのじゃ！\n見事王子を捕らえた者には、\nわらわが手料理を馳走してやろう！", "face": "u547"}, {"name": "山賊", "text": "でへへ……任してくだせえ、姐御！", "face": "u4"}, {"name": "兵士", "text": "なにが姐御だ！　そこをどけ！\n堕姫様の手料理は俺のものだ！", "face": "u6"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "なるほど……誘惑の術ですか。\nまた王子を捕らえに来るなんて、\nあの人も懲りませんね。", "face": "l5822f73cad14"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "なら今度こそ懲らしめてあげなくては。\n王子、兵たちを正気に戻すためにも、\nひとまずここは応戦しましょう。", "face": "u114"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "堕姫", "text": "く、ふふ……強いのう。\nそれでこそ、わらわの王子じゃ。", "face": "u547"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "王子は貴方のものではありません。\nさあ、今度こそ大人しく捕まりなさ――。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………。", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "王子……退いて頂けませんか？\n貴方が前に立っていては、\n堕姫に縄をかけることができませんよ？", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "……………………王子？", "face": "lfd3f42c51a24"}, {"name": "堕姫", "text": "くははははっ！　無駄じゃ無駄じゃ！\n王子はすでに、わらわの誘惑の術に\nかかっているのだからのぅ！", "face": "u547"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "な……なんですって！？", "face": "lfd3f42c51a24"}, {"name": "マオ", "text": "嘘だ！　王子みたいに意志の強い人が\nお前なんかの術に簡単にかかるものか！", "face": "u361"}, {"name": "堕姫", "text": "ああ、そうとも。だから王子には\n最も強力にして最も解けにくい術をかけた。\nわらわの力を凝縮した、この宝貝を使ってな……。", "face": "u547"}, {"name": "堕姫", "text": "だが、一度術をかけてしまえば\nもうこんなものは不要じゃ！", "face": "u547"}, {"name": "マオ", "text": "なッ……宝貝を壊した！？", "face": "u361"}, {"name": "堕姫", "text": "くふふ。術をかけたこの宝貝で解除の術を施さねば、\n王子にかけた誘惑の術は死ぬまで解けることはない。", "face": "u547"}, {"name": "堕姫", "text": "その宝貝を壊した今、\n王子は永久にわらわのものじゃ！\nのう、王子？", "face": "u547"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "う……嘘ですよね、王子？", "face": "lfd3f42c51a24"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………。", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "そんな……アンナさんの制止を振り切って\n堕姫のもとへ行ってしまうなんて……。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "堕姫", "text": "どうした？　他に王子を止められる者はおらぬのか？\n止めなければ王子はわらわと共に去ってしまうぞ？", "face": "u547"}, {"name": "堕姫", "text": "くふふっ！　そうかそうか、一人もおらぬか！\nでは、王子は頂いていくぞ？　くふふっ、くははははっ！", "face": "u547"}]}], "active": true}